                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-03"><hi rendition="#italic">September 3,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill reports that Imperial command to sign the protocol was received on
                    the 28th ultimo by the Chinese plenipotentiaries. * * *</p>
                <p>Chinese say that they are waiting for edicts on punishments and
                    examinations.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
